# Bandsintown "Artist API Key" for kaicastro.com's Shows panel.
# Get one from https://artists.bandsintown.com -> Settings -> General -> API Key
# (tied to Kai's Bandsintown for Artists account -- login required).
# Copy this file to .env and fill in the real value; without it the site
# falls back to a placeholder app_id and, if that's rejected, shows a link
# straight to https://www.bandsintown.com/a/12427370-kai-castro instead.
VITE_BANDSINTOWN_APP_ID=
